    "studentFacingPrompts": [
      "> Find the value of each expression mentally. \\(6 \\times 2\\) \\(6 \\times 2 \\times 10\\) \\(6 \\times 20 \\times 10\\) \\(60 \\times 20 \\times 10\\)",
      "> Description: 6-sided rectangular prism. Straight sides. All side lengths meet at right angles. Side lengths. Bottom, 7 feet. Right side rises 5 feet, then goes left 5 feet, goes up an unlabeled length, then goes left an unlabeled length, then goes down 7 feet. Width shown as 2 feet. Partner A: Find the volume of Figure 1. Partner B: Find the volume of Figure 2. Figure 1 Description: 8-sided figure. Straight sides. All side lengths meet at right angles. Width shown as 2 feet.&nbsp;Side lengths. Bottom, 7 feet. Right side rises 5 frrt, then goes left 5 feet, goes up an unknown length, goes left an unknown length, and goes down 7 feet.&nbsp; Caption: Figure 1 Figure 2 Description: 8-sided figure. Straight sides. All side lengths meet at right angles. Width length, 7 inches. Side lengths. Bottom, 5 inches. Right side rises 5 inches, then goes left 9 inches. Then goes down left side 3 inches, then goes right 4 inches, then down 2 inches to meet the bottom side.&nbsp; Caption: Figure 2",
      "> Explain how each expression represents the volume of the figure. Show your thinking. Organize it so it can be followed by others. \\(((2 \\times 3) \\times4) + ((3 \\times 3) \\times 2)\\) \\((5 \\times 6) + (3 \\times 4)\\) Description: Figure composed of two rectangular prisms. Front prism: 3 cubes by 3 cubes by 3 cubes. Back prism: 2 cubes by 4 cubes by 3 cubes.&nbsp; How does each expression represent the volume of the prism? Explain or show your thinking. Organize it so it can be followed by others. \\((5\\times8\\times6) + (5\\times4\\times9)\\) cubic inches \\((5\\times4\\times3) + (5\\times12\\times6)\\) cubic inches Description: 8-sided figure.&nbsp;Straight sides. All side lengths meet at right angles. Side lengths. Bottom, unlabeled length. Right side rises 6 inches, then goes left 8 inches, then goes up 3 inches, and then goes left 4 inches. Left side, unlabeled length. Width shown as 5 inches.&nbsp;"
    ]
  },
  "sourceMathChecks": "78 ft³; 259 in³; (5×8×6)+(5×4×9)=(5×4×3)+(5×12×6)=420 in³",
